@startuml
title Website Development UML state machine diagram

state "Homepage" as Homepage
Homepage : entry/Start page
Homepage : do/Show navigation bar
Homepage : exit/Select a project or career opportunity

state "Projects view" as ProjectsView
ProjectsView : entry/Select a project from the navigation bar
ProjectsView : do/Show photos and videos of projects
ProjectsView : exit/Choose to view updates or open an application form for employment or internship

state "Career Opportunities view" as CareerOpportunitiesView
CareerOpportunitiesView : entry/Select career opportunities from the navigation bar
CareerOpportunitiesView : do/Show updates and application form for employment or internship
CareerOpportunitiesView : exit/Submit a job application

state "Updates view" as UpdatesView
UpdatesView : entry/Choose to view updates when viewing career opportunities
UpdatesView : do/Show updates
UpdatesView : exit/Return to Career Opportunities view

state "Application Form view" as ApplicationFormView
ApplicationFormView : entry/Choose to open an application form for employment or internship when viewing career opportunities
ApplicationFormView : do/Show application form
ApplicationFormView : exit/Submit a job application

state "Job Application submitted" as JobApplicationSubmitted
JobApplicationSubmitted : entry/Submit a job application
JobApplicationSubmitted : do/Check submitted applications
JobApplicationSubmitted : exit/Return to Career Opportunities view

[*] --> Homepage

Homepage --> ProjectsView : [Select a project from the navigation bar]
ProjectsView --> CareerOpportunitiesView : [Choose to view updates or open an application form for employment or internship]

CareerOpportunitiesView --> UpdatesView : [Choose to view updates when viewing career opportunities]
UpdatesView --> CareerOpportunitiesView : [Return to Career Opportunities view]

CareerOpportunitiesView --> ApplicationFormView : [Choose to open an application form for employment or internship when viewing career opportunities]
ApplicationFormView --> JobApplicationSubmitted : [Submit a job application]

JobApplicationSubmitted --> [*] : [Check submitted applications]
[*] --> Homepage

@enduml
